From 878777e4e5495a7d25c443646fcde9cc2e24c797 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:04:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] client: Bound the responses read from untrusted servers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The daemon reads image server and VM agent replies whole into memory,
and the API client or the guest chooses the server. Add an optional
response size limit to the client and set it on those connections.

This addresses GHSA-3jgx-fpg2-x499 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 84c0b32f774c7ef2169653ce08371678a1d29a0a)
---
